re places full of interesting and unusual, as well as dark and terrifying situations.<br><br><br><strong>THE TEAM</strong><br>Attu Games is a husband-and-wife team from the Czech Republic. We try to make everything ourselves - from drawing, animations, and storytelling to programming, music, and publishing our games.<br>Scarlet Deer Inn draws inspiration from the amazing movies by the Ghibli studio, medieval Europe and Slavic folklore.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553260/extras/2536c4497c843fae8e454a196d2d8d5f.avif?t=1754750666\" /></div>",
